 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa, why does my",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 0.98,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "movie go blurry,",
   "s": 1.04,
   "e": 1.74,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "then sharp again?",
   "s": 1.8,
   "e": 3.01,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Because it isn't one movie.",
   "s": 3.38,
   "e": 5.09,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a pile of little pieces.",
   "s": 5.19,
   "e": 6.95,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Pieces of a movie?",
   "s": 7.28,
   "e": 8.41,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "A few seconds each.",
   "s": 8.64,
   "e": 9.95,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And every piece is",
   "s": 10.17,
   "e": 11.1,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "stored in several qualities.",
   "s": 11.16,
   "e": 12.89,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Small and blurry.",
   "s": 13.24,
   "e": 14.49,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Big and sharp.",
   "s": 14.82,
   "e": 16.01,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So who decides which",
   "s": 16.32,
   "e": 17.14,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "one I get?",
   "s": 17.2,
   "e": 18.09,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Your player.",
   "s": 18.29,
   "e": 19.11,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Before each piece,",
   "s": 19.3,
   "e": 20.42,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "it checks how fast",
   "s": 20.48,
   "e": 21.42,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "the last one arrived.",
   "s": 21.48,
   "e": 22.97,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And if the wifi is slow?",
   "s": 23.12,
   "e": 24.59,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "It asks for the small piece.",
   "s": 25,
   "e": 26.71,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Less to carry,",
   "s": 27.06,
   "e": 28.03,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "so it arrives on time.",
   "s": 28.13,
   "e": 29.53,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Why not wait for",
   "s": 29.88,
   "e": 30.52,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "the sharp one?",
   "s": 30.58,
   "e": 31.49,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the picture freezes.",
   "s": 31.84,
   "e": 33.23,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "A blur you forgive.",
   "s": 33.44,
   "e": 34.79,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "A spinning circle, never.",
   "s": 35.04,
   "e": 36.97,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So it just guesses?",
   "s": 37.04,
   "e": 38.25,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "It keeps a cushion.",
   "s": 38.32,
   "e": 39.37,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Seconds of movie,",
   "s": 39.79,
   "e": 40.89,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "downloaded ahead of what you're watching.",
   "s": 40.97,
   "e": 42.73,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And a fat cushion means sharp?",
   "s": 42.9,
   "e": 44.65,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Fat cushion,",
   "s": 44.72,
   "e": 45.67,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "it risks the big piece.",
   "s": 45.78,
   "e": 47.25,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Thin cushion,",
   "s": 47.64,
   "e": 48.39,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "it plays safe.",
   "s": 48.58,
   "e": 49.69,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the wifi comes back,",
   "s": 49.82,
   "e": 50.9,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "and it's sharp again.",
   "s": 50.96,
   "e": 52.33,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Piece by piece.",
   "s": 52.62,
   "e": 53.75,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody has to tell you.",
   "s": 53.98,
   "e": 55.42,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So the blur is",
   "s": 55.48,
   "e": 56.6,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "it looking after me?",
   "s": 56.66,
   "e": 57.81,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's looking after your patience.",
   "s": 58.52,
   "e": 60.29,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Which was never great.",
   "s": 60.73,
   "e": 62.03,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  }
 ],
